    "evenflo_faq_rtWMJA": {
      "type": "evenflo-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_3FCGkp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "checkbox_expanded": false,
            "title": "Will this car seat fit my child?",
            "content": "<p>The Evenflo Shyft™ DualRide™ has been designed to fit a wide range of children. The information provided in the table below should help you determine if it is the right fit for your child.</p><p>Rear-facing weight range: 3 - 35 lb. (1.4 – 15.8 kg)</p><p>Rear-facing height range: 15.7 - 32 in (40 - 81 cm)</p><p>Rear-facing minimum age: birth</p><p>Lowest harness position (with infant insert): 4.5 in (11.4 cm)</p><p>Highest harness position: 11.5 in (29.2 cm)</p><p>Inner buckle position: 3 in (7.6 cm)</p><p>Middle buckle position: 4 in (10.2 cm)</p><p>Outer buckle position: 5 in (12.7 cm)</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_VtkCde": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "checkbox_expanded": false,
            "title": "Is it okay for my child’s feet to touch the vehicle seat back when in rear-facing mode?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The Evenflo Shyft™ DualRide™ is designed to accommodate children in rear-facing mode until they are 32 in/81 cmtall or weigh 35 lb./15.8 kg.and the top of their head is at least 1 in (2.5 cm) below the top of the headrest. It is okay for your child’s feet to touch the back of the vehicle seat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_BHWVgp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "checkbox_expanded": false,
            "title": "How long will my child be able to use their infant car seat?",
            "content": "<p>The Evenflo Shyft™ DualRide™ can be used until the child reaches either 35 lbs. (15.8 kg), 32 inches (81 cm), or the top of their head is less than 1 inch (2.5 cm) below the top of the headrest. Once your child reaches any of these three measurements, they will need to transition to a convertible or all-in-one car seat in rear-facing mode.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_h9cXaY": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "checkbox_expanded": false,
            "title": "What are the different ways you can use the Shyft™ DualRide™?",
            "content": "<p>The Shyft™ DualRide™ is a versatile infant car seat and stroller combo with multiple modes: it’s an infant car seat with the base (stroller’s wheels remain attached to the base), it’s a stroller, it’s an infant carrier with the stroller wheels attached, and it’s an infant carrier without the stroller wheels attached. In your vehicle, you can install the Shyft™ DualRide™ with the base with either lower anchors or the vehicle seat belt. You can also install the Shyft™ DualRide™ without the base using the vehicle seat belt. Without the base, the Shyft™ DualRide™ can be installed with or without the stroller frame.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
